{"id": "7th-t3-u3-q299", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "matching", "level": "SSLC", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "7", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "3", "unit_id": "ta-t3-u3-maanudam", "lesson_id": "lesson-13-payanam", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "ta-t3-u3-term3-authors-master-match", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "பருவம் 3 பாட நூல்களையும் அவற்றின் ஆசிரியர்களையும் தொகுத்துப் பொருத்துக:\na) பிரயாணம் - 1. பாவண்ணன் (பயணம் சிறுகதை நூல்)\nb) சேரமான் காதலி - 2. கண்ணதாசன் (சாகித்திய அகாதெமி புதினம்)\nc) மகளுக்குச் சொன்ன கதை - 3. சே. பிருந்தா (தன்னை அறிதல் நூல்)\nd) அறநெறிச்சாரம் - 4. முனைப்பாடியார் (அறம் என்னும் கதிர் நூல்)"}], "options": {"A": "a-3, b-4, c-1, d-2", "B": "a-4, b-3, c-2, d-1", "C": "a-1, b-2, c-3, d-4", "D": "a-2, b-1, c-4, d-3"}, "explanation": "பருவம் 3 ஆசிரியர்கள் ஒப்பீடு: பிரயாணம் - பாவண்ணன் (1); சேரமான் காதலி - கண்ணதாசன் (2); மகளுக்குச் சொன்ன கதை - சே. பிருந்தா (3); அறநெறிச்சாரம் - முனைப்பாடியார் (4). சரியான வரிசை: 1, 2, 3, 4 (C)."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Match the literary works across Term 3 with their respective authors:\na) Pirayaanam - 1. Paavannan (Payanam source work)\nb) Cheraman Kaadhali - 2. Kannadasan (Sahitya novel)\nc) Magalukku Sonna Kathai - 3. S. Brindha (Thannai Arithal source)\nd) Aranericharam - 4. Munaippaadiyaar (Aram ennum kadhir)"}], "options": {"A": "a-3, b-4, c-1, d-2", "B": "a-4, b-3, c-2, d-1", "C": "a-1, b-2, c-3, d-4", "D": "a-2, b-1, c-4, d-3"}, "explanation": "Term 3 authors synthesis: Pirayaanam -> Paavannan; Cheraman Kaadhali -> Kannadasan; Magalukku Sonna Kathai -> Brindha; Aranericharam -> Munaippaadiyaar. Match: a-1, b-2, c-3, d-4."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": [{"left_ta": "பிரயாணம்", "left_en": "Pirayaanam", "right_ta": "பாவண்ணன் (பயணம் சிறுகதை நூல்)", "right_en": "Paavannan (Payanam source)"}, {"left_ta": "சேரமான் காதலி", "left_en": "Cheraman Kaadhali", "right_ta": "கண்ணதாசன் (சாகித்திய அகாதெமி புதினம்)", "right_en": "Kannadasan (Sahitya novel)"}, {"left_ta": "மகளுக்குச் சொன்ன கதை", "left_en": "Magalukku Sonna Kathai", "right_ta": "சே. பிருந்தா (தன்னை அறிதல் நூல்)", "right_en": "S. Brindha (Thannai Arithal)"}, {"left_ta": "அறநெறிச்சாரம்", "left_en": "Aranericharam", "right_ta": "முனைப்பாடியார் (அறம் என்னும் கதிர் நூல்)", "right_en": "Munaippaadiyaar (Aram ennum kadhir)"}], "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "C", "accepted_keys": ["C"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "answer_notes": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false, "shuffle_options": true, "is_active_eligible": true}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "7", "term": "3", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 58, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": null, "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null, "question_number": null, "official_question_paper_url": null, "official_answer_key_url": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["master_match", "authors_comparison", "matching"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-03T00:00:00Z", "updated_by": null, "updated_at": null, "verified_by": "subject_expert_tamil", "verified_at": "2026-11-03T00:00:00Z", "archived_at": null}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "7th-t3-u3-q300", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "grammar", "level": "SSLC", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "7", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "3", "unit_id": "ta-t3-u3-maanudam", "lesson_id": "lesson-13-payanam", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "ta-t3-u3-sandhi-mithivandi", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "'மிதி + வண்டி' என்பது 'மிதிவண்டி' எனப் புணர்கிறது. இத்தொடரில் நிலைமொழி ஈற்றில் இகரமும் வருமொழி முதலில் வகரமும் வரும்போது வல்லினம் மிகாமல் இயல்பாகப் புணர்ந்ததன் காரணம் யாது?"}], "options": {"A": "வகரம் மெல்லின மெய் என்பதால் மிகவில்லை", "B": "வகரம் உயிரெழுத்து என்பதால் உடம்படுமெய் தோன்றியது", "C": "நிலைமொழி குற்றியலுகரம் என்பதால் கெட்டது", "D": "வகரம் வல்லின எழுத்து (க, ச, த, ப) அல்லாத இடையின மெய் என்பதால் வல்லொற்று மிகவில்லை"}, "explanation": "புணர்ச்சி இலக்கணப்படி: வருமொழி முதலில் வல்லின எழுத்துகள் (க, ச, த, ப) வரும்போது மட்டுமே சில இடங்களில் ஒற்று மிகும்; 'வ' என்பது இடையின மெய்யெழுத்து (ய, ர, ல, வ, ழ, ள) என்பதால் வல்லொற்று மிகாமல் இயல்பாகப் புணரும்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "'Mithi + vandi' merges as 'Mithivandi'. Why does it combine without consonant doubling when followed by 'va'?"}], "options": {"A": "Va is a nasal consonant so it did not double", "B": "Va is a vowel so glide appeared", "C": "Initial word is kurriyalugaram so it elided", "D": "Va is an Idaiyinam consonant (not vallinam k, s, th, p) hence no hard plosive doubling occurs"}, "explanation": "'Va' is a medial consonant (Idaiyinam), not a plosive (Vallinam k, ch, th, p). Therefore no plosive gemination occurs."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": {"left": [], "right": []}, "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "D", "accepted_keys": ["D"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "answer_notes": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false, "shuffle_options": true, "is_active_eligible": true}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "7", "term": "3", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 55, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": null, "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null, "question_number": null, "official_question_paper_url": null, "official_answer_key_url": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["sandhi", "idaiyinam", "mithivandi", "grammar"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-03T00:00:00Z", "updated_by": null, "updated_at": null, "verified_by": "subject_expert_tamil", "verified_at": "2026-11-03T00:00:00Z", "archived_at": null}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "7th-t3-u3-q301", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "grammar", "level": "SSLC", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "7", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "3", "unit_id": "ta-t3-u3-maanudam", "lesson_id": "lesson-13-payanam", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "ta-t3-u3-sandhi-eethuvakkum", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "'ஈத்துவக்கும்' என்னும் சொல்லைச் சரியாகப் பிரித்தெழுதக் கிடைக்கும் வடிவம் மற்றும் புணர்ச்சி விதி யாது?"}], "options": {"A": "ஈத்து + உவக்கும் (உயிர்வரின் உக்குறள் மெய்விட்டோடும்)", "B": "ஈ + துவக்கும் (தோன்றல் புணர்ச்சி)", "C": "ஈத்து + வக்கும் (கெடுதல் புணர்ச்சி)", "D": "ஈத்த + உவக்கும் (இயல்புப் புணர்ச்சி)"}, "explanation": "'ஈத்துவக்கும்' = ஈத்து + உவக்கும். நிலைமொழி ஈற்றில் உள்ள குற்றியலுகரம் வருமொழி முதல் உயிரெழுத்து (உ) வரக் கெட்டது (ஈத் + உவக்கும் = ஈத்துவக்கும்: விதி: உயிர்வரின் உக்குறள் மெய்விட்டோடும்; உடல்மேல் உயிர்வந்து ஒன்றுவது இயல்பே)."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "What is the correct splitting of 'Eethuvakkum' and which sandhi rule operates?"}], "options": {"A": "Eethu + uvakkum (Elision of short u before vowel)", "B": "Ee + thuvakkum (Epenthesis)", "C": "Eethu + vakkum (Elision)", "D": "Eetha + uvakkum (Normal)"}, "explanation": "'Eethu + uvakkum' = Eethuvakkum. The terminal kurriyalugaram is elided before the initial vowel 'u', followed by consonant-vowel bonding."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": {"left": [], "right": []}, "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "A", "accepted_keys": ["A"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "answer_notes": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false, "shuffle_options": true, "is_active_eligible": true}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "7", "term": "3", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 55, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": null, "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null, "question_number": null, "official_question_paper_url": null, "official_answer_key_url": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["sandhi", "split_words", "eethuvakkum", "grammar"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-03T00:00:00Z", "updated_by": null, "updated_at": null, "verified_by": "subject_expert_tamil", "verified_at": "2026-11-03T00:00:00Z", "archived_at": null}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "7th-t3-u3-q302", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "grammar", "level": "SSLC", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "7", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "3", "unit_id": "ta-t3-u3-maanudam", "lesson_id": "lesson-13-payanam", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "ta-t3-u3-metrics-paavannan", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "'பாவண்ணன்' என்ற சொல்லின் மொத்த மாத்திரை அளவைக் கணக்கிடுக:"}], "options": {"A": "4.0 மாத்திரைகள்", "B": "5.0 மாத்திரைகள்", "C": "5.5 மாத்திரைகள்", "D": "6.0 மாத்திரைகள்"}, "explanation": "மாத்திரை கணக்கீடு:\nபா (நெடில்) = 2\nவ (குறில்) = 1\nண் (மெய்) = 0.5\nண (குறில்) = 1\nன் (மெய்) = 0.5\nகூடுதல் = 2 + 1 + 0.5 + 1 + 0.5 = 5.0 மாத்திரைகள்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Calculate the total Maathirai count for the name 'Paavannan':"}], "options": {"A": "4.0 Maathirais", "B": "5.0 Maathirais", "C": "5.5 Maathirais", "D": "6.0 Maathirais"}, "explanation": "Metrics: Paa (2) + va (1) + n (0.5) + na (1) + n (0.5) = 5.0 Maathirais."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": {"left": [], "right": []}, "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "B", "accepted_keys": ["B"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "answer_notes": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false, "shuffle_options": true, "is_active_eligible": true}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "7", "term": "3", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 58, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": null, "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam