{"id": "7th-t3-u3-q360", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "odd_one_out", "level": "SSLC", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "7", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "3", "unit_id": "ta-t3-u3-maanudam", "lesson_id": "lesson-15-thirukkural-part2", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "ta-t3-u3-naadu-jewels-odd-one-out", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "திருவள்ளுவர் ஒரு நாட்டிற்கு அணிகலன் என்று கூறும் ஐந்து உறுப்புகளுள் பொருந்தாத வேறுபட்ட ஒன்று எது?"}], "options": {"A": "பிணியின்மை", "B": "விளைச்சல் (விளைவு)", "C": "ஏமம் (பாதுகாப்பு)", "D": "வறுமை"}, "explanation": "குறள் 8: 'பிணியின்மை செல்வம் விளைவின்பம் ஏமம் / அணியென்ப நாட்டிற்கிவ் வைந்து'. ஐந்து அணிகள்: பிணியின்மை, செல்வம், விளைவு, இன்பம், ஏமம். 'வறுமை' என்பது நாட்டிற்கு அழகன்று; மாறாக அது நாட்டிற்கு அழிவாகும். எனவே வறுமை பொருந்தாதது."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Which of the following is NOT one of the 5 ornaments of a nation described by Valluvar?"}], "options": {"A": "Pinayinmai (Health)", "B": "Vilaivu (Yield)", "C": "Aemam (Defense)", "D": "Varumai (Poverty)"}, "explanation": "Kural 8 lists: health, wealth, yield, joy, defense. 'Poverty' (Varumai) is a blight, not an ornament. Hence D is the odd one."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": {"left": [], "right": []}, "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "D", "accepted_keys": ["D"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "answer_notes": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false, "shuffle_options": true, "is_active_eligible": true}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Cor